  "card.stepRowTitle": "Press one above the composer",
  "card.stepRowBody": "One press writes those words into the draft; editing and sending stay with the user. A dashed one is a quick capsule and sends itself about a second later; a fold holds capsules that work just like the ones outside it. The ⚡ at the head of the row saves the line the composer is holding as a new capsule.",
